# L'Orchidee ETL - daily run at 05:00 server time (after last night's bookings
# are settled, and before staff arrive to check dashboards).
# Install with: crontab -e   (as the user that will own the venv/logs)
#
# Adjust the path to wherever you deployed the lorchidee-etl folder on the VPS.
0 5 * * * /opt/lorchidee-etl/cron/run_etl.sh
